      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xidan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By the 1970s, Xidan joined Qianmen and Wangfujing as one of Beijing's three major commercial districts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xidan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Xidan Wall, erected in 1978, became a focal point for the 1979 Beijing Spring democracy movement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
